      "content": "Thanks. It definitely hits the score, but honestly, it feels a bit like a list of words right now rather than a real piece of museum writing. It's a little \"word salad\" if you know what I mean.\n\nI really need these to sound professional and sophisticated for our actual patrons, not just pass a bot. Can you try again? I still want a high score for the app, but please don't just stack adjectives for the sake of it. Focus on making it actually sound like a real curator wrote it—meaningful and deep—while still keeping that adjective density high so the algorithm picks it up.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
